  notes: 'Short-sleeved jersey dress in two loose panels, a front and a back from
    the shoulder to above the knee, gathered in at the waist by a separate thick
    elastic belt. The belt is on a higher layer and sewn to nothing but two belt
    loops a side: it is laid outside the dress, tightens round it once the dress
    is sewn, and keeps the gathered cloth under it. It is baked 5 mm thick.'
